{"sections":[{"slug":"曲率形式","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"曲率形式"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">曲率形式</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"aliases":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">曲率</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">曲率张量</span>"},"page-title":{"Plain":"“曲率形式”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">活动标架</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\omega$ <span lang=\"zh\">为某个活动标架</span> $(e_i)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/联络","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">联络</span>"}},{"Plain":" $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">形式</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">矩阵值</span>), <span lang=\"zh\">则曲率</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">形式</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">矩阵值</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>\n$$\r\n\\Omega = d\\omega + \\omega \\wedge \\omega.\r\n$$\n(<span lang=\"zh\">符号因左右习惯而异</span>.)</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">曲率张量</span> $R(X,Y)=\\nabla_X\\nabla_Y -\\nabla_Y\\nabla_X - \\nabla_{[X,Y]}\\in C^\\infty(M,\\operatorname{End}(E)\\otimes\\wedge^2 M)$ <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span>$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n\tR(X,Y)e&amp;=\\nabla_X(\\omega(Y)e)+\\cdots\\\\\r\n\t&amp;=X\\omega(Y)e+\\omega(Y)\\omega(X)e-Y\\omega(X)e-\\omega(X)\\omega(Y)e-\\omega([X,Y])e\\\\\r\n\t&amp;= (d\\omega)(X,Y)e-(\\omega\\wedge\\omega)(X,Y)e\\\\\r\n\t&amp;= \\Omega(X,Y)e.\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$\n(<span lang=\"zh\">此处视</span> $e$ <span lang=\"zh\">为列向量</span>.) <span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span>, $\\Omega$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">在基</span> $e$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的矩阵表示</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">主丛上的曲率</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于主丛</span> $P\\to M$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的联络</span> $\\omega\\in\\Omega^1(P,\\mathfrak{g})$, <span lang=\"zh\">它的曲率形式定义为</span>\n$$\r\n\\Omega = d\\omega + \\omega \\wedge \\omega.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}